{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34450","headline":"和袭美寄题玉霄峰叶涵象尊师所居 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美寄题玉霄峰叶涵象尊师所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天台一万八千丈，师在浮云端掩扉。\n永夜祗知星斗大，深秋犹见海山微。\n风前几降青毛节，雪後应披白羽衣。\n南望烟霞空再拜，欲将飞魄问灵威。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}